OL,3,GNEWSA'There should be a Barbie with a
OL,4,Astoma too'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Barbie fanatic is urging the toy
OL,7,Fmanufacturer to create a doll with a
OL,8,Fstoma bag.
OL,10,FImali Chislett, from Bournemouth, has
OL,11,Flived with a stoma since 2024.
OL,13,FThe 25-year-old is calling for an
OL,14,F"Ostomy Barbie" because she said "it
OL,15,Fwould be nice if children had a better
OL,16,Funderstanding of what a stoma is and
OL,17,Fwhat it allows people to do".
OL,19,FMattel, which already has an inclusive
OL,20,Frange featuring physical and
OL,21,Fneurodivergent conditions, has been
OL,22,Fasked for its thoughts on the idea.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
